@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Get all movies (expect 200 + array)
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies

### 2. Get one existing movie (expect 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies/1

### 3. Get a missing movie (expect 404 MOVIE_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies/999

### 4. Create a valid movie (expect 201 + new id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Arrival",
  "year": 2016,
  "genre": "Sci-Fi"
}

### 5. Create an invalid movie (expect 400 VALIDATION_ERROR)
POST {{baseUrl}}/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "year": "not a number"
}

### 6. Replace a movie with PUT (expect 200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Inception: Updated Edition",
  "year": 2010,
  "genre": "Sci-Fi"
}

### 7. PUT with a missing property (expect 400)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Inception"
}

### 8. PUT a missing movie (expect 404)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/movies/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ghost Movie",
  "year": 2000,
  "genre": "Drama"
}

### 9. Partially update a movie with PATCH (expect 200, only year changes)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2011
}

### 10. PATCH with an invalid value (expect 400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 1500
}

### 11. Filter by genre and year, sorted (expect 200, only matches)
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies?genre=sci-fi&minYear=2000&sort=year

### 12. Sort by title (expect 200, alphabetical)
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies?sort=title

### 13. Filter with no matches (expect 200 + [])
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies?genre=Horror

### 14. Invalid minYear (expect 400 INVALID_QUERY)
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies?minYear=invalid

### 15. Unsupported sort value (expect 400 INVALID_QUERY)
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies?sort=rating

### 16. Delete an existing movie (expect 204, empty body)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/movies/2

### 17. Delete the same movie again (expect 404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/movies/2

### 18. Unknown route (expect 404 ROUTE_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{baseUrl}}/does-not-exist

### 19. Broken JSON body (expect 400 INVALID_JSON)
POST {{baseUrl}}/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Broken